## Requirements

- Proxmox VE installed on the host
- Root access to the Proxmox node
- Internet access for downloading templates and packages
- Optional: a public domain for production TLS and email

## Quick start

```bash
# SSH into your Proxmox host as root
# Clone the repo
cd /root
git clone https://github.com/clasica-magicia/bda-rpu.git
cd /root/bda-rpu
chmod +x install.sh
./install.sh
```

The installer will:

1. Harden the Proxmox host
2. Configure the network bridge
3. Download the Ubuntu 22.04 LXC template
4. Deploy each service in sequence
5. Generate certificates
6. Configure the Nginx reverse proxy
7. Install maintenance cron jobs
8. Deploy the status dashboard

