## Security notes

- Change all default passwords before exposing services to the internet.
- Use real DNS and Let's Encrypt if possible.
- Mail-in-a-Box requires port 25 and proper MX/SPF/DKIM/DMARC configuration.
- The default generated certificates are self-signed unless a valid domain is configured.

